the State is a set.
this's Done is a boolean.

the Game is an actor.
this can Spawn.
this's Spawn does...
    when State's Done is true?
        this is ok!
    or?
        State's Done is true.
        start this's Spawn as Next...
            or?
        this is ok!

the App is a script.

State's Done is false.
do Game's Spawn...
    or?
log "spawned".
